    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " appeared to Abraham at the sacred trees of Mamre. As Abraham was sitting at the entrance of his tent during the hottest part of the day, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.13.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Heb 13.2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he looked up and saw three men standing there. As soon as he saw them, he ran out to meet them. Bowing down with his face touching the ground, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he said, “Sirs, please do not pass by my home without stopping; I am here to serve you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let me bring some water for you to wash your feet; you can rest here beneath this tree. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will also bring a bit of food; it will give you strength to continue your journey. You have honoured me by coming to my home, so let me serve you.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They replied, “Thank you; we accept.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abraham hurried into the tent and said to Sarah, “Quick, take a sack of your best flour, and bake some bread.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then he ran to the herd and picked out a calf that was tender and fat, and gave it to a servant, who hurried to get it ready. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He took some cream, some milk, and the meat, and set the food before the men. There under the tree he served them himself, and they ate.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then they asked him, “Where is your wife Sarah?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“She is there in the tent,” he answered.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.9.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 9.9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "One of them said, “Nine months from now",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18.10",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nine months from now",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "This time next year.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " I will come back, and your wife Sarah will have a son.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sarah was behind him, at the door of the tent, listening. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abraham and Sarah were very old, and Sarah had stopped having her monthly periods. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1PE.3.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Pet 3.6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Sarah laughed to herself and said, “Now that I am old and worn out, can I still enjoy sex? And besides, my husband is old too.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " asked Abraham, “Why did Sarah laugh and say, ‘Can I really have a child when I am so old?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.1.37"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 1.37",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Is anything too hard for the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "? As I said, nine months from now I will return, and Sarah will have a son.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Because Sarah was afraid, she denied it. “I didn't laugh,” she said.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Yes, you did,” he replied. “You laughed.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the men left and went to a place where they could look down at Sodom, and Abraham went with them to send them on their way. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to himself, “I will not hide from Abraham what I am going to do. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "His descendants will become a great and mighty nation, and through him I will bless all the nations.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18.18",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "through",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "…",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "nations",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "all the nations will ask me to bless them as I have blessed him.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I have chosen him in order that he may command his sons and his descendants to obey me and to do what is right and just. If they do, I will do everything for him that I have promised.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:19"
